  "root_problem": "CRM dispute tickets roughly doubled from a ~600/month baseline in Jun-Jul to 1180 (Aug) and 1260 (Sep) 2026 (E-04); a manual-read route-completion shortfall (88% vs 95% target, 9200 accounts, Aug-Sep, E-05) — coincident with the field reader staffing gap reported since July — drove increased estimate substitution that accounts for the ESTIMATED-read 41% share of disputed bills (1240/3025, E-01). This field-read mechanism does not explain the ACTUAL-read majority (59%) of disputes, since slow response handling (rejected, E-03) and a tariff change (rejected, E-02) have both been ruled out as causes."
